{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年33歲的英皇歌手許靖韻（Angela）憑藉紮實唱功與清新外貌，近年人氣持續攀升。近日她趁著工作空檔，飛往度假勝地峇里島享受陽光與海灘。心情大靚的許靖韻頻頻在社交平台大派福利，繼日前率先上載身穿大露背晚裝、疑似真空上陣的唯美夕陽景照後，近日她再度「加碼」大解放，罕有分享在海邊戲水的三點式短片，睇到一眾粉絲嘩嘩聲！</p><figure><img alt=\"許靖韻趁著工作空檔飛往度假勝地峇里島放鬆，一身露背晚裝非常吸睛。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194303191232024576687320.png/nlCeM8rLFVaZ2roivoNXIZPk6umDWF469_UFr_f1Ba8\"/><figcaption>許靖韻趁著工作空檔飛往度假勝地峇里島放鬆，一身露背晚裝非常吸睛。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"美背美景。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194303605348241408879351.png/eox85z-2_8r0NIgpb3WRtbI-oDUvvlNprz0Gq689Bqs\"/><figcaption>美背美景。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大Deep V。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194303887423574016937250.jpeg/tGXQ58ydVQWAeVTVq8M3fDvWL2AflN9aiXQR34l0Ed8\"/><figcaption>大Deep V。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"疑真空上陣。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194304240969846784978651.jpeg/CawZMzoZcWnt04pZiMegA9Ei2mxZhnGPcfJ76nHye-o\"/><figcaption>疑真空上陣。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><p>罕晒三點式：旅遊限定</p><p>影片中所見，身在峇里海灘的許靖韻迎著夕陽餘暉，原本身上披著一件白色長袖鬆身恤衫，隨後興奮地將外套除下拋向鏡頭，展現內裡的亮粉紅色三點式。全程大玩「男友視角」的她，在清澈的海水中踏浪嬉戲，心情顯得非常雀躍，一時開懷大笑對著鏡頭回眸，一時又張開雙臂擁抱夕陽。在逆光照耀下，許靖韻高挑修長身形一覽無遺，白滑玉背及纖腰盡收眼底，散發出健康性感美。</p><figure><img alt=\"許靖韻罕有分享三點式照。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194306209948110848951647.png/cJETpmQTsShWTExevcp2wr7_CkxyI9iN5W0Gz-VtBs8\"/><figcaption>許靖韻罕有分享三點式照。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"許靖韻開心脫去外衣。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194306568552714240982650.png/BLPOGQaQ-cCpd9tsz-CCv1t6dWBSaBiCOqLHSTqix0k\"/><figcaption>許靖韻開心脫去外衣。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"白滑玉背及纖腰盡收眼底。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194306884127952896608257.png/fgWlVvBjpjW0pioDY0kyjmk-xyjRkOPcO8xQHzvMUB8\"/><figcaption>白滑玉背及纖腰盡收眼底。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><p>事實上，早幾日許靖韻才先後分享過幾張大露背及超深Deep V照，大騷骨感美背，甚至更疑似真空上陣。想不到事隔短短數日，向來走斯文路線的許靖韻尺度再突破，直接換上三點式泳裝，她更留言寫道：「Don’t wake me I’m not dreaming」。而影片一出，大批網民紛紛留言狂讚：「索」、「好靚」、「讚到爆」；亦有網民藉著她昔日的稱號「小背心」幽默笑問：「現在是『小比基尼』？哈哈」，許靖韻親回：「旅遊限定」。可見她相當享受這趟峇里之旅。</p><figure><img alt=\"開心戲水。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194307239146426368146205.png/5WSgnoGSl53GZRj1ecOBr13pIDajOoh4_gIspP4CLKQ\"/><figcaption>開心戲水。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吸睛。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194307752491487232619234.png/oHKvdl87WG-N1WAnDZotb8OQyBVK4M92RIwoUkSMKFI\"/><figcaption>吸睛。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"健康性感。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194307927255552000729461.png/cI1qB_SvcdaHuZy3ndpFyt48YypQWHID31qgaN9aoGg\"/><figcaption>健康性感。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好享受。（IG@angelachingwan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194308239538262016847365.png/uYC0SXvdCnhmayvWxygej_5iW3CR1RulNX5z4jV-c-I\"/><figcaption>好享受。（IG@angelachingwan）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:21:14.661684+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":884,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T15:18:40.733227+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:18:40.733227+00:00","content_hash":"4bfddced36c0076e957a52e355e510147546a5fecaf0b793b07f708fba949e71","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}